If a unit-modulus $z$ satisfied $z^2-3z+1=0$, division by $z$ would give $z+z^{-1}=3$. But on the unit circle this is $2\operatorname{Re}(z)$, which lies between $-2$ and $2$. Therefore no finite angular grid contains a figure-eight root.

